  "description": "Builds Mercado Libre CBT (Global Selling) listing payloads from 1688 product JSON. Category-attribute driven: compiles the platform's own attribute schema into a listing template, then cleans source data against it - variation axis planning with graceful fallbacks, size-chart binding, and a full audit trail of every field decision. Reports gaps instead of inventing values. Zero external dependencies; uses only token-free public category endpoints.",
